Package: FAIRbioHeadersTools
Title: Native R Reader, Checksum Verifier and Contract Validator for FAIR-bioHeaders
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("FAIR-bioHeaders-Tools contributors", email = "molik@fhref.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads, verifies and validates FAIR-bioHeaders file-bound metadata
    (docs/FORMAT.md): a vendored FIPS 180-4 SHA-512/256 implementation produces
    the file checksum, header YAML is parsed with rule-exact byte-line semantics,
    and the released FHR, FHP and FHGFF3 contracts are validated as JSON Schema
    draft/2020-12 with asserted formats, through 'jsonvalidate' and its 'ajv'
    engine, which runs in the V8 JavaScript engine.
    Ships the pinned contract copies and their provenance, an opt-in lane for
    unreleased draft contracts under rule V7, and a runner for the shared
    language-neutral conformance vectors.
License: MPL-2.0 | file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    digest,
    jsonlite,
    jsonvalidate (>= 1.5.0),
    yaml (>= 2.3.7)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
SystemRequirements: C99 (the vendored SHA-512/256 core in src/); zlib
    (the strict gzip reader in src/gz.c); a C compiler is required to build
    this package from source
NeedsCompilation: yes
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
